    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Seed's End Agricultural Co-op. As part of a debt relief opportunity, you have been provided a plot of land to farm in the Sol sector on planet 3. Grow food for your home world, and you will receive a cut of the proceeds. The rest is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Large open world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Play with up to 4 friends (no hard limit, but may experience lag)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Farm, fish, and cook to bring food to your community and fame to your family</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Defend your farm from night monsters and bureaucrats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Cars, trucks, boats (coming soon), tractors, and other vehicles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Seed's End Agricultural Co-op. As part of a debt relief opportunity, you have been provided a plot of land to farm in the Sol sector on planet 3. Grow food for your home world, and you will receive a cut of the proceeds. The rest is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Large open world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Play with up to 4 friends (no hard limit, but may experience lag)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Farm, fish, and cook to bring food to your community and fame to your family</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Defend your farm from night monsters and bureaucrats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Cars, trucks, boats (coming soon), tractors, and other vehicles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Seed's End is an open world farming and adventure game. Play alone or with others as you expand your farm, discover new technology, and explore the land and sea.",
